<section class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-4">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-line p-6 sm:p-8">
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex bg-cream border border-line rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wide">FAQ</div>
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-3">Got questions?</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Instant delivery, GST, refunds — all clear.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 divide-y divide-line border border-line rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
      <details class="group p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white open:bg-paper transition" open>
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-sm">How fast is delivery? <i class="ri-add-line group-open:ri-subtract-line text-muted"></i></summary>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">10 seconds. Email + WhatsApp with PDF/EPUB/MOBI. Also in My Downloads.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white open:bg-paper transition">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-sm">Do I get lifetime access? <i class="ri-add-line group-open:ri-subtract-line text-muted"></i></summary>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Yes. Re-download anytime from your email link or downloads page. Free updates included.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white open:bg-paper transition">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-sm">Refund policy? <i class="ri-add-line group-open:ri-subtract-line text-muted"></i></summary>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">30-day money back, no questions. Just email support@mavizio.store</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group p-4 sm:p-5 bg-white open:bg-paper transition">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-sm">GST invoice? <i class="ri-add-line group-open:ri-subtract-line text-muted"></i></summary>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mt-2">Yes, GST invoice auto-emailed. Add GSTIN at checkout for business.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"FAQ Clean","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
